Vanilla data
------------
data/vanilla/ contains facts about Minecraft: Java Edition (identifiers, numeric protocol
ids, block state properties, collision shapes, packet ids, default item components and
similar values), extracted from Mojang's server jar and normalised for interoperability.
The tables in crates/vanillite-data/src/generated/ are generated from them. Minecraft is a
trademark of Mojang AB. Vanillite is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mojang or Microsoft.
No Minecraft code, data pack contents, structures or assets are included: the server
downloads Mojang's server jar on first start and reads the Vanilla data pack from it.

Bedrock data
------------
crates/vanillite-bedrock/data/ is generated by tools/bedrock-data/generate.py from GeyserMC's
mappings (https://github.com/GeyserMC/mappings) and Bedrock resources of Geyser
(https://github.com/GeyserMC/Geyser), licensed under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2019-2026 GeyserMC (http://geysermc.org), including the replacement blocks and
items for older Bedrock releases from Geyser's conversion tables. See
crates/vanillite-bedrock/data/README.md.

Alternate Current
-----------------
crates/vanillite-game/src/block/redstone/alternate_current.rs implements the redstone wire
algorithm of Alternate Current by Space Walker
(https://github.com/SpaceWalkerRS/alternate-current), licensed under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2022 Space Walker. The code is written anew; no code was copied.
